note bottom of turn
  on_turn_timer copied the candidate's turn
  into last_turn_text, reset the turn and
  called start_followups (auto_followups).
end note

note bottom of en
  begin(Followups, ...) cancelled the previous
  Followups request; each accepted item is
  sent as FOLLOWUPS_READY via emit_if_current.
end note

note top of m
  Ids are UUIDv7 simple hex (32 chars), shortened here.
  start_time / end_time: ms since meeting start;
  started_at, created_at: Unix ms.
end note
